      "v": 4,
      "zh": "用三层大石头，一层新木头，经费要出于王库；",
      "en": "with three layers of large stones[NOTE:1] and one[NOTE:2] layer of timber. The expense is to be subsidized[NOTE:3] by the royal treasury.[NOTE:4]",
